flowchart TD
  accTitle: Where do I return after a task?
  accDescr: Proposed navigation preserves task identity, origin, history and read-only child context. Proposed Round-09 design; not runtime, acceptance or native navigation evidence. Tracker #2 and #66 retain decisions and milestones.

  %% Generated from maps.json; SVG uses the stored geometry, Mermaid lays itself out.
  draft["P1 DESIGN PROPOSAL | New task draft | Unassigned; opening starts nothing | Capture creates a distinct identity"]
  task["P1 DESIGN PROPOSAL | Captured task | Outcome, context and next decision | Same identity through the journey"]
  result["P1 DESIGN PROPOSAL | Review and accept result | Accept exact prepared revision | Inspect artifacts and uncertainty"]
  accepted["P1 DESIGN PROPOSAL | Accepted task | Prior result and history remain | New task or reopen are distinct"]
  reader["P1 DESIGN PROPOSAL | Child reader | Read-only: output and dependencies | Model, harness, environment, attempt"]
  history["P1 DESIGN PROPOSAL | Retained history | Accepted revisions and receipts | Return to the same task context"]
  reopen["P1 DESIGN PROPOSAL | Reopened task | Same identity; settlement cleared | Idle until new intent and valid scope"]
  work["P1 DESIGN PROPOSAL | Work / origin | Back restores selection and filters | Opening a detail starts no work"]
  draft --> task
  task --> result
  result --> accepted
  accepted -.->|"reopen"| reopen
  task -.->|"inspect"| reader
  reader -.->|"back"| task
  accepted -.->|"open"| history
  history -.->|"back"| accepted
  work -->|"open"| task
  accepted -.->|"new task"| draft
  task -.-> work
